84 #uuid "6ffb62c9-06bc-54ed-a237-28e9635fc6fa" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186340152 #edb/ref 1081 "II only" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186340152 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186340152 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "72703321-1679-5b08-aab6-32e985e25b41" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186340171 #edb/ref 1081 "None" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186340171 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186340171 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "74517a98-ee70-5879-af22-ee6f1cbffcda" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341244 #edb/ref 1081 "I only" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341244 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341244 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "ef265337-e4c5-5117-bd72-923b375019cb" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186339727 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340127 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340152 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340171 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186341244 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1079 #edb/ref 17592186340171 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186341834 #edb/ref 1080 #uuid "fa75a06c-11fb-5ef6-a1f6-3f25d8c6ebf9" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186342194 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186341834 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186342194 #edb/ref 1069 "q-74218" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186342194 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186342194 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following sets is a subspace of ${R}^{3}?$\n\n- $A={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=1}$\n- $B={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:xyz=0}$\n- $C={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:y=-1}$" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186342194 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5037faf6-6f8a-5ea2-800f-2c136a3bb59e" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186342194 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's analyze each of the subsets.\n\n- The set $A$ is not a subspace because it does not contain the zero vector. Indeed, $0=⟨0,0,0⟩$ does not satisfy the condition ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=1$ since ${0}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{0}^{2}\\ne 1.$\n\n- The set $B$ is not a subspace because it is not closed under vector addition. Indeed, both $a=⟨1,0,1⟩$ and $b=⟨0,1,1⟩$ belong to $B$ but \n\n$$\na+b=⟨1,0,1⟩+⟨0,1,1⟩=⟨1,1,2⟩\n$$\n\n \ndoes not satisfy the condition $xyz=0$ since $1\\cdot 1\\cdot 2\\ne 0.$\n\n- The set $C$ is not a subspace because it does not contain the zero vector. Indeed, $0=⟨0,0,0⟩$ does not satisfy the condition $y=-1$ since $0\\ne -1.$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"None.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407356 #edb/ref 1081 "II only" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407356 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407356 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "368e8346-dba0-5eab-bd72-0c8e01860bad" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407357 #edb/ref 1081 "I only" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407357 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407357 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "4c5b8efe-00bb-54bf-84b6-0c9423e627f4" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407358 #edb/ref 1081 "None" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407358 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407358 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "70ea133b-bffa-5ff6-b9b3-2c01068c74c9" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407359 #edb/ref 1081 "III only" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407359 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407359 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "99103a99-9e82-5c24-8f3c-8db058da3029" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407360 #edb/ref 1081 "I and II only" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407360 #edb/ref 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407360 #edb/ref 1084 #uuid "baba48d0-d9f